				<r3d:description language="eng">The Mansfeld&#039;s World Database of Agriculture and Horticultural Crops is an online database. As a contribution to the project &quot;Federal Information System on Genetic Resources&quot; (BIG, http://www.big-flora.de/). It reflects the contents of &quot;Mansfeld&#039;s Encyclopedia of Agricultural and Horticultural Crops&quot; (Hanelt and IPK 2001) and contains information on 6,100 crop plant species, excluding forestry and ornamental plants. Each species entry provides nomenclature and synonymy, common names in different languages, spontaneous distribution and regions of cultivation, uses, images, references, but also the ancestral species and notes on the phylogeny, variation and history.</r3d:description>
